## SQ-VDF-02 | Mashed Potatoes / Mashed Sweet Potatoes recipes
@group A
@commands Recipe lookup by output: `moredelight:mashed_potatoes`, `veggiesdelight:mashed_potatoes`
@pass Mashed Potatoes: pot `creativedelight:...mashed_potatoes` (potato or potato slices x2, milk, bowl) and grid `mashed_potatoes_cooked_manual_only`; Mashed Sweet Potatoes: pot `mashed_sweet_potatoes` (sweet potato or sliced sweet potato x2, milk, bowl) and grid `mashed_sweet_potatoes_cooked_manual_only` (3 baked sweet potatoes); no `moredelight:cooking/mashed_potatoes`, `veggiesdelight:cooking/mashed_potatoes` or its Vintage version (VD-48)
@fails ids differ: check the CD id prefix
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> zq makes moredelight:mashed_potatoes
> zq makes veggiesdelight:mashed_potatoes
> zq rdetail mashed_
reject moredelight:cooking/mashed_potatoes
reject veggiesdelight:cooking/mashed_potatoes
reject veggiesdelight:\S*vintagedelight\S*mashed_potatoes
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:\S*mashed_potatoes_cooked_manual_only \{
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:\S*mashed_sweet_potatoes_cooked_manual_only \{
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:\S*farmersdelightcooking/mashed_potatoes\S* \{
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:\S*farmersdelightcooking/mashed_sweet_potatoes\S* \{
look which output id is Mashed Potatoes and which Mashed Sweet Potatoes; pot: potato or potato slices x2, milk, bowl / sweet potato or sliced sweet potato x2, milk, bowl; sweet grid recipe: 3 baked sweet potatoes

