## SQ-VDF-04 | quiche, vegan pizza, zucchini boat and bowl: manual_only + one assembly each
@group A
@commands Recipe lookup: `veggiesdelight:zucchini_quiche`, `vegan_pizza`, `stuffed_zucchini_boat`, `stuffed_zucchinis`
@pass quiche: oven only (no grid or assembly recipe); pizza: one shaped `vegan_pizza_manual_only` (row 2 dough, sauce, dough) + one assembly on `#forge:dough`; boat and bowl: one assembly each on the roasted zucchini beside their grid / pot recipes; no `veggiesdelight:zucchini_quiche`, `compat/vintagedelight/zucchini_quiche`, `vegan_pizza` ids (VD-51, VD-52)
