## SQ-VDF-10 | doughs compost at 85 %
@group A
@commands Hopper into a composter, one stack each: `create:dough`, `vintagedelight:oat_dough`, `vintagedelight:cucumber_dough`, `veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_dough`, `farmersdelight:wheat_dough`; or the compost probe
@pass each adds a layer at 85 % (owner 2026-11-01); cucumber noodles unchanged
@fails `doughs` category order in CD `compost_rules.js`
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> dumpcompost
waitlog Dumped compost table 300
shell python3 -I $INST/tools/scratch_query/dumpq.py compost create:dough=0.85 vintagedelight:oat_dough=0.85 vintagedelight:cucumber_dough=0.85 veggiesdelight:sweet_potato_dough=0.85 farmersdelight:wheat_dough=0.85
shell python3 -I -c "import json;n=json.load(open('kubejs/exported/compost/compost.json'))['now'];print({k:v for k,v in n.items() if 'noodle' in k and 'cucumber' in k})"
